Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:11.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I was half dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:19.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I failed yet again to make Lady \NDoux a cruel and vicious demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What exactly am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:29.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:32.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:35.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll talk to Yairya about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:37.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:42.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hey, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What in the world happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:46.86,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:54.70,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,YAIRYA – FIRST-CLASS WITCH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:48.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yairya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.10,0:00:52.75,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,At this rate, we witches are finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.30,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,And Jahi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.62,0:00:57.20,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:58.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:36.51,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Witches' Potions \NWork Way Too Good!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:36.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE WITCHES' POTIONS WORK WAY TOO GOOD!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The witches are finished because of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:42.77,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:50.77,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Back then, His Majesty sent us to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:53.96,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,invade various locations in \Norder to unify the demon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:54.96,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:55.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:09.60,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DEMONS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:03:00.45,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Because you all expanded our territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.90,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,more and more demons \Nwho were in the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:06.05,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,were sent out to various locations \Nfor development and maintenance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:09.62,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,As a result, we ended up having \Nto do the work around the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:12.68,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,that the demons were supposed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:17.96,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,We're supposed to concoct various potions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.05,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,but we're all exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:21.96,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,We're at our limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:24.77,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I don't even know what to say to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.46,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,But I guess I feel bad for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:30.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:32.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Heave ho, heave ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:36.44,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Heave ho... Heave ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:45.25,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sweepy sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.78,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Your trials with Lady Doux \Naren't going well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.52,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sweepy sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.70,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sweepy, sweepy sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:54.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sweepy, sweepy sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:51.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:57.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yairya, I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who can make a \Npotion that'll make Lady Doux evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.59,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MUS – JUNIOR WITCH
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:07.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must be Mus. I'm sure Yairya \Nhas already filled you in, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you so surprised?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:19.48,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,B-B-B-Because I told her that I couldn't \Npossibly do this and turned her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:26.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You can't even make a single \Npotion? You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.49,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,STAB
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.95,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'll do it! I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:31.82,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Please just give me a little more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:34.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,S-Sure... If you'll get right to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:35.72,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:40.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:44.12,flashback,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,There's no official formulation for \Na drug that draws out one's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:48.99,flashback,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,But there's someone named Mus that's \Ncompletely self-taught in her research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.77,flashback,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,There's only a slight possibility, \Nbut she might be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:55.66,flashback,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,It's just she's a bit different...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:05:00.27,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Let's see... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.38,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is she actually going \Nto be able to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.30,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-It's done...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.21,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,It's probably a bit bitter though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:13.16,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GURGLE GURGLE GURGLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:13.16,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux can eat green peppers, so it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:17.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Bitterness aside, \Nis this even drinkable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:20.25,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,It's made only with things \Ngood for your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:21.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:25.81,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You need to be more cautious, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:31.13,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,There's a reaction! Sh-She \Nshould be evil now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:33.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How do you feel, Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You dummy-ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux said something rude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:41.32,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,You chicken butt! You macaroon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.24,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll krill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Though she seems to be just a tad off...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But we're going in the right direction! \NCan you adjust the formula?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.19,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.08,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm super angy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.91,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I've never seen Lady \NDoux like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:59.46,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,If we continue adjusting the formula...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:02.13,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,It's done. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:03.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's about time, you slowypoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.87,Default,DOUXS,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:13.77,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Wah! She multiplied!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:14.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.85,Default,DOUX A,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:17.82,Default,DOUX C,0,0,0,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.40,Default,DOUX D,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:24.40,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What kind of formula adjustment \Ncould possibly lead to this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.40,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.65,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,She should turn back with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:33.09,Default,MOUSE DOUX,0,0,0,,There are so many...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:34.12,Default,CAT DOUX,0,0,0,,Douxs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you just complicating \Nthis even more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.50,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'll adjust it some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:42.88,Default,DOUXS,0,0,0,,Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,My eyes are flickering...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.01,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Th-This should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:50.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Now we're strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:53.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So close! Now, if she was just evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:54.60,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,O-One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.47,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DWAHAHAHA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:07:03.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,FWAHAHAHA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:01.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Well, at least her voice \Nsounds more evil now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.48,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:10.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Well, at least Lady Doux \Nreturned to her normal self.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.36,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:15.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's calm down a bit. \NCould I get some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.27,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,R-Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.00,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,H-Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's a potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:37.07,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I mistook it for tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:41.18,Default,JAHI (MUS),0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry! \NI'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:41.18,top,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Why didn't you check more carefully?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:50.28,Default,BOTH,0,0,0,,Huh? We've switched bodies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.13,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Now something's been summoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:09.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! It's a Mr. Octopus! Mr. Octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:10.77,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.05,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,C-Curses...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.35,italics,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,I can't do anything in this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.20,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,H-Hey, Mus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.69,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:28.43,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Mus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:35.03,Default,JAHI (MUS),0,0,0,,I'll make up for this by \Ncutting my stomach open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.90,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Wait no! That's my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:42.16,Default,MUS (JAHI),0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:50.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,W-We're finally back to normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:54.30,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:58.59,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,There's no way I could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:05.08,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,There's so much I don't know even \Nwhen I'm making one potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:09.06,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I'm so useless, and all \NI do is cause trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.38,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.29,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux had a lot of fun though!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.02,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:22.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,There were a lot of me, I transformed, \Nand then there was a Mr. Octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:27.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Can all witches make lots \Nof potions this amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:33.38,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,N-No! I can't even make them \Nthe way I actually want...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:37.75,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Everyone above me can make potions \Nwithout making a single mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:42.23,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,All of mine are incomplete or failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.36,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Even today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:50.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then let's go ask them how \Nto make them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:51.52,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:56.78,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I-I couldn't possibly! Even if I go,\N I'm just going to cause trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:01.67,top,MUS,0,0,0,,W-W-W-Wait! Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:02.91,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:05.41,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:11.17,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,I can't believe you actually went to Mus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.81,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha?! Yairya, how dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.29,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:21.46,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,You've brought me this incomplete \Npotion to make someone evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.50,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,so you must've come to get advice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:25.71,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,U-Um, uh... yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:29.44,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I guess that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.39,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I just keep messing up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:35.64,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I'm sure it won't go well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:43.41,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you're busy... And I'm sure \NI'm bothering you... So I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:48.58,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,If you squirm anymore,\NI'm putting you into a pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.21,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:52.67,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,If you want to show me \Nsomething, straighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:55.60,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.95,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-Hey! You're using that here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:02.09,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Th-Th-Th-That might be dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:05.57,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,It's fine. Even if something \Nhappens, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:21.73,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:25.99,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,I can feel my fatigue melting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:27.15,Default,SLAVE A,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:30.13,Default,SLAVE A,0,0,0,,I don't really know why, \Nbut my fatigue's all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:33.17,Default,SLAVE C,0,0,0,,Same here! My body feels so much lighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:37.38,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,But why? Also, what was \Nall that smoke just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:43.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Everyone in the castle \Nsuddenly feels better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That range of effect is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:49.88,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,U-Um... This is uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:52.58,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,How could you make something \Nlike this, Mus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:53.35,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:55.21,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,It's brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:55.97,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:59.74,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,I've never seen a potion like this! \NHow in the world did you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.17,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Huh?! B-But this was a failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:06.49,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,It might be a failure, \Nbut it's still amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:07.24,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:08.74,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Mus,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:12.12,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,I want to teach you all kinds of things \Nand learn all kinds of things from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.66,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,If we teach each other \Nthings we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.91,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be able to make \Nsomething even more amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:18.51,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Let's work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.13,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:24.12,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:28.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux, too! Doux wants to learn things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:30.33,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Let's make them together, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:34.05,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,What kind of potion did \Nyou want to make, Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:37.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A super yummy potion \Nthat you can drink lots of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:42.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So I just went through \Nall this for nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:49.53,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Hero Is Just Too Unreliable!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:49.53,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE HERO IS JUST TOO UNRELIABLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:02.27,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I came all this way to \Ntake down the demon king
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:04.39,Default,UR,0,0,0,,and somehow got separated \Nfrom my party...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:05.68,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:09.55,Default,UR,0,0,0,,In this situation, I should... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:14.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:20.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:22.50,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Wait! Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:23.57,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux's name is Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I was playing hide-and-seek with Papa
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:33.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and found a hole and \Nslid all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.96,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's your name, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:39.60,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Ur. Ur the Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:42.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A hero! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.99,italics,UR,0,0,0,,I may be a hero, \Nbut there're so many of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.78,italics,UR,0,0,0,,I mean, there's basically a hero \Nfor every village in existence...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:54.35,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Ahem. I'm looking for my party \Nthat I've been separated from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:57.58,Default,UR,0,0,0,,But first, we need to get \Nyou back up to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.19,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Eek! A bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:07.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So many giant Mr. Spiders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:12.99,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I can't! No one told me there'd \Nbe bugs that huge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:16.04,Default,UR,0,0,0,,There... There has to be \Nsome solution to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.86,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Th-This is the {\i1}Adventurer's Tome{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.99,Default,UR,0,0,0,,It has all kinds of knowledge and \Ntricks needed for adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.71,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Th-There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:30.04,Default,UR,0,0,0,,"For bug-type demons, use \Nsweet things or hellfire"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:31.38,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I don't have anything sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:34.18,Default,UR,0,0,0,,And I need to be able to use powerful \Nmagic to produce hellfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux knows how.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:36.93,Default,UR,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:38.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:40.85,Default,UR,0,0,0,,That's not a very big flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:45.23,Default,UR,0,0,0,,They're gathering to the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.61,Default,UR,0,0,0,,But it's no use! There's \Njust too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:51.62,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Sweet things!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:54.24,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Okay, if we just use this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:59.05,Default,UR,0,0,0,,This was a demon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:02.75,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Of course there wouldn't be strawberries \Ngrowing in a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.80,Default,UR,0,0,0,,This is probably an earth-type. \NHow do I deal with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:08.50,Default,STRAWBERRY DEMONS,0,0,0,,Strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:12.55,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Doux! Look up how to deal with \Nthese earth-type demons for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:13.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:18.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"How to make strawberry tarts"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:18.52,top,UR,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:23.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh! Okay, it says to use \Nwater for earth-type demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux has some!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.90,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, you can use \Nwater-based magic, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:34.03,Default,UR,0,0,0,,It's just water!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.79,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Doux! No, these are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:43.00,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They gave me a strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:48.74,Default,UR,0,0,0,,These were {\i1}actually{\i0} strawberries?! \NWhat's the right answer here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:55.41,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"ADVENTURE, ADVENTURE!"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: YURI MORITA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:03.79,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Adventure, adventure, it's \Ntime for an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.79,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Deep, deep down a pitfall
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:11.90,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's look over here and look over there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:16.18,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's see everything that's down here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:20.43,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:24.48,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:28.61,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I'm down here with my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:33.24,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,So it's not scary at all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:38.87,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Adventure, adventure, it's \Ntime for an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:42.87,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Deep, deep down a pitfall
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:47.38,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's look over here and look over there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:51.38,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's see everything that's down here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.51,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.87,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:03.81,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I'm down here with my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:08.38,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,So it's not scary at all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:22.47,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Looks like we were able to \Nat least lose the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:24.85,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:29.56,Default,UR,0,0,0,,M-My book!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:32.23,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Doux, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:35.32,Default,UR,0,0,0,,This demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.35,Default,UR,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:41.49,Default,UR,0,0,0,,This is the demon who sent me and \Nmy friends flying and separated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:45.00,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.64,Default,UR,0,0,0,,If this thing goes berserk, \Nwe won't be able to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:49.88,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Doux! W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.08,Default,UR,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.13,Default,UR,0,0,0,,She was eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:57.79,Default,UR,0,0,0,,N-N-No! I-I need to hurry and save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:18:00.01,Default,UR,0,0,0,,B-But my {\i1}Adventurer's Tome{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:03.64,Default,UR,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:07.93,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do with a demon \Nlike that unless the book tells me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.90,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:16.12,flashback,PARTY A,0,0,0,,You're always relying on that \Ndumb book! This is a battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:18.11,flashback,PARTY B,0,0,0,,If you can't make your own decisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:20.31,flashback,PARTY B,0,0,0,,you can't protect those\Nyou want to protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.57,Default,UR,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:25.12,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.91,Default,UR,0,0,0,,a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:35.05,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Take that! Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:39.70,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.49,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Doux, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.52,Default,UR,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's a stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:52.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You see, this was stuck in their throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:19:01.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They were probably thrashing \Naround because it hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.55,Default,UR,0,0,0,,That's why you went into its mouth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:07.66,Default,UR,0,0,0,,B-But how did you know that \Nwas inside their throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I just had a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:10.79,Default,UR,0,0,0,,A-A hunch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:14.73,Default,UR,0,0,0,,But... it could've swallowed you whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:16.21,Default,UR,0,0,0,,You tried to save it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.67,Default,UR,0,0,0,,without the {\i1}Adventurer's Tome{\i0} \Nor any actual solution...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:21.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But you did that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:21.93,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:25.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You saved me even without the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:30.13,italics,UR,0,0,0,,I've been relying on that \Nbook this whole time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:35.35,italics,UR,0,0,0,,That {\i0}Adventurer's Tome{\i1} was given to \Nme by my father, who was a great hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:41.51,italics,UR,0,0,0,,He recorded everything he learned \Nand experienced on his adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:47.50,italics,UR,0,0,0,,It's filled with his desire for me \Nto become a full-fledged hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:52.04,italics,UR,0,0,0,,I'm so weak... that without that book...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:57.16,italics,UR,0,0,0,,If I don't rely on that book, I didn't \Nthink I could protect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:59.08,italics,UR,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.79,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,Hey, Ur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:03.64,Default,PARTY B,0,0,0,,We finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.72,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Those voices...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:06.22,Default,UR,0,0,0,,My party's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:08.31,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,We're getting the heck outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.85,Default,UR,0,0,0,,And they brought something \Ninsane with them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:17.32,Default,UR,0,0,0,,W-W-W-Wait a m-minute! What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:20.10,Default,PARTY B,0,0,0,,No idea! But it's probably \Nthe boss of this dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:22.19,Default,PARTY B,0,0,0,,Our weapons and magic\Ndon't do anything to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.19,0:20:24.26,Default,PARTY C,0,0,0,,At this rate, it's gonna catch up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:26.92,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,No! We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:30.50,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:33.58,Default,UR,0,0,0,,Guys! Look after her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.33,Default,UR,0,0,0,,I'll buy you some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:37.38,Default,PARTY C,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying, Ur?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:40.63,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,Yeah! And you don't even \Nhave your {\i1}Adventurer's Tome{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:42.03,Default,UR,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:46.76,Default,UR,0,0,0,,You guys and Doux have opened my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.31,italics,UR,0,0,0,,Even without that book...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:56.35,italics,UR,0,0,0,,I can protect others!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:13.04,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,To think there was a hole in the forest \Nthat connected to this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.70,0:21:15.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:17.79,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:19.34,Default,PARTY C,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.88,Default,PARTY,0,0,0,,Demon King Ahriman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.65,Default,UR,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:25.96,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.15,Default,UR,0,0,0,,"Papa"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:32.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux! I'm so sorry! \NYou must've been so lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:37.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope! The hero saved me, so I was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:39.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah! Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:42.84,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's going on here, Ur?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:45.65,Default,PARTY A,0,0,0,,Why were you with the \Ndemon king's daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:47.95,Default,UR,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.55,0:21:54.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE HERO'S PARTY'S PERSPECTIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:49.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hero's party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:54.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If you've come this far, you \Nmust've come to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:57.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,To thank you for taking \Ncare of Doux for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:21:59.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'll let you have a go \Nat me. So come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:03.76,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,N-No thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.39,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Aw, well that's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:08.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
